    <string name="news_reddit_body">Join us in http://reddit.com/r/basketmanager</string>
    <string name="news_play_scores_title">Scores and matches</string>
    <string name="news_play_scores_body">If you want to see scores and stats of matches, you can see it in Calendar.</string>
    <string name="news_play_calendar_title">Play more than one game</string>
    <string name="news_play_calendar_body">If you want to play more than one game, go calendar and do long click in the day you want to go, or just click the day and click in PLAY button, at bottom of your screen.</string>
    <string name="news_choose_your_lineup_title">Choose your lineup</string>
    <string name="news_choose_your_lineup_body">Choose the players in your team. Starters (blue) and reserves (green) in Team, in Lineup Tab.</string>
    <string name="news_choose_your_tactics_title">Choose your tactics</string>
    <string name="news_choose_your_tactics_body">Choose the way you want to play, in Team, in Tactics Tab. And choose who’s gonna be your Star players.</string>
    <string name="news_trade_your_players_title">Trade players</string>
    <string name="news_trade_your_players_body">To trade your players, go Trades in the Menu. you can choose your own team to see what the others can offer.</string>
    <string name="news_sign_free_agents_title">Sign Free Agents</string>
    <string name="news_sign_free_agents_body">"If you have space in your team, its very interesting going Free Agents sign new players. If the offer is not good enough, he won't accept it and will be unavalaible for new offers."</string>
    <string name="news_look_statistics_title">Look Statistics</string>
    <string name="news_look_statistics_body">You can see statistics of all the players in a team, including yours. This is very helpful to know what tactics you should use.</string>
    <string name="news_free_agency_trade_title">Free agency and trades</string>
    <string name="news_free_agency_trade_body">Free agency and trades will close on day 90.</string>
    <string name="news_per_title">What is PER</string>
    <string name="news_per_body">"One of the most important stats is the PER, invented by John Hollinger, it's a rating of the most important statistics combined. In essence, it's how much your player contributes to victory."</string>
